      "name": "launch-grid-collapse-redundant-batch-dim",
      "description": "Host-shim collapse of a redundant batch dim in the launch grid kills ~98% empty workgroups on chunked linear attention: ~2.8x on the largest case",
      "keywords": [
        "launch-overhead",
        "grid-collapse",
        "host-shim",
